  "content": "\n\n<center><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6PkCWkC/xaeros-waystone-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></center>\n \n <br>\n\n<center><a title=\"https://discord.gg/RjWCgrnBZz\" href=\"https://discord.gg/RjWCgrnBZz\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1066142815043719208?color=7289da&label=Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=7289da&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"314\" height=\"70\"></a></center>\n \n<br>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xYmrwP9/description.png\" alt=\"\" ></center>\n\n<br> \n\n- 本模组不支持 Xaero 的小地图（公平玩法版）\n- 本模组是 Waystones2Waypoints 的继任者。当玩家激活传送石时，它会在 Xaero 的世界地图和小地图上生成路点。\n- 客户端与服务器端均需安装此模组。\n- 本作并非分支版本。鉴于前作已停止维护，我们为其全新开发了支持 Forge 1.19.2、1.19.3、1.19.4、1.20 及 1.20.1 版本的新模组。\n\n# 模组开发者\n-  <a href=\"https://www.fiverr.com/shoqapik12\">Shoqapik12</a>\n\n <br>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://mmcreviews.com/all/mods/xaeros-minimap-world-map-waystones-compatibility-forge/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://150012028.v2.pressablecdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/mmcreview_banner_long.png\" width=\"625\" height=\"104\" alt=\"Minecraft 模组评测\" /></a></p>\n\n<center><a title=\"https://billing.kinetichosting.net/aff.php?aff=509\" href=\"https://billing.kinetichosting.net/aff.php?aff=509\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qR3jbBp/precisemodpacker.png\" alt=\"\"></a></center>",
